   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Azo Tle Nelli In Tlalticpac**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Extraction Point**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Only One Way**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Against Agamemnon**: back after 103 archived shows (962 days); rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Horseradish Road**: back after 58 archived shows (494 days); rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **From the Nebraska Plant**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Bell Swamp Connection**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Only Takes a Few**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2024-04-12.SBD.Matrix** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 23 songs; 106 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: I Hope You Dance [1]\n- The audience microphone was placed in the loge; taping was permitted by the band's team and venue staff [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2024-04-12.SBD.Matrix**: taped by roffels; source: Soundboard - Zoom f3 32-bit float 192 khz Rode NT-SF1 Ambisonic Microphone (decoded to stereo hypercards)- Zoom f6 32-bit float 96 KHZ [1]. Also: Mixed in Vegas 21, processed with Ozone 10 and Audacity, and delivered as 24-bit 48 kHz FLAC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by First Avenue: [the Mountain Goats â Palace Theatre - First Avenue](https://first-avenue.com/event/2024-04-the-mountain-goats/) [3]\n- Fan art by First Avenue: [the Mountain Goats â Palace Theatre - First Avenue](https://first-avenue.com/event/2024-04-the-mountain-goats/) [4]",
